ion\":{\"ref\":\"d50\"},\"ref\":\"d50\",\"snippet\":\" ... a British actor of Nigerian descent. |\\n| ' | 1932 | In the adventure film, Anglo-Indian actor Boris Karloff and white actress Myrna Loy play Asians Fu Manchu and Fah Lo See. The Chinese embassy in Washington, D.C. issued a formal complaint against the film.Christopher Frayling, quoted in \\\"Fu ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Whitewashing_in_film\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d51\"},\"ref\":\"d51\",\"snippet\":\" ... he is a Negro.\\\" Quoting \\n\\nAfter the United States acquired the area in the Louisiana Purchase, Creoles resisted American attempts to impose their binary racial culture. In other American states, slavery had been a racialized lens through which people with any African descent were considered lower in status ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Louisiana_Creole_people\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d52\"},\"ref\":\"d52\",\"snippet\":\" ... I will close this article with a quote from Werner Herzog. It will sum up their perfectly:\\n\\n\\\"People think we had a love-hate relationship. Well, I did not love him, nor did I hate him. We had mutual respect for each other, even as we both planned ... \",\"title\":\"https://jesuitroundup.org/2023/02/klaus-kinski-and-werner-herzog-the-most-intense-relationship-in-cinema/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d53\"},\"ref\":\"d53\",\"snippet\":\" ... winners\\nCategory:Screen Awards winners\\nCategory:International Indian Film Academy Awards winners\\nCategory:Indian male film actors\\nCategory:Indian male stage actors\\nCategory:Indian male television actors\\nCategory: