ia · IMDb |\\n\\n| Gone in 60 Seconds Starring: H.B ... \",\"title\":\"https://carsandracingstuff.com/library/video/videoguide.php\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d65\"},\"ref\":\"d65\",\"snippet\":\" ... It ran three movies a year over 16 years, until 2011, when it ended its association with the series. The final film was Beyond the Blackboard, on April 24, 2011.\\n\\nOn November 27, 2011, Hallmark Hall of Fame returned to ABC with Have a Little Faith, which debuted ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hallmark_Hall_of_Fame\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d62\"},\"ref\":\"d62\",\"snippet\":\" ... C'era una volta il West\\n\\nOnce Upon a Time in the West ( is a 1968 epic spaghetti Western film directed by Sergio Leone, who co-wrote it with Sergio Donati based on a story by Dario Argento, Bernardo Bertolucci and Leone. It stars Henry Fonda, cast against ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Once_Upon_a_Time_in_the_West\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d30\"},\"ref\":\"d30\",\"snippet\":\" ... Part 2,\\\" based on Frank Herbert's iconic 1965 sci-fi novel, making it one of the top-grossing movies of the year with $282 million domestically. Even more recent is the film \\\"Wicked,\\\" whose adaptation lineage runs deep: It's based on the hit 2003 Broadway musical ... \",\"title\":\"https://stacker.com/stories/movies/100-best-movies-based-books\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d39\"},\"ref\":\"d39\",\"snippet\":\" ... Bridge on the River Kwai and Lawrence of Arabia, but it still works exceedingly well for a film of its size, and is worth devoting 3+ hours of one's time to.\\n\\nDoctor Zhivago\\n\\nCast\\n\\n-\\n\\nOmar Sharif\\n\\n-\\n\\nGeraldine Chaplin\\n\\n-\\n\\nRod Steiger\\n\\n- Release Date\\n\\n- December 22, 1965\\n\\n- Runtime\\n\\n- 200 ... \",\"title\":\"https://collider.com/best-movies-1965-ranked/\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"58ed370b3cdfe948a9cad53cb81e51e704ddb145457691ee070c88c2e4b728ec\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"40d33e12f5c996e9b2630fa02eed7b6617da4e2f0b64f6f37e1fb11e2d39b767\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"One Million Years B.C. 1966 film Wikipedia runtime cast\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":true,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d25\"},\"ref\":\"d25\",\"snippet\":\"\",\"title\":\"https://editorial.rottentomatoes.com/guide/best-stop-motion-animated-movies/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d17\"},\"ref\":\"d17\",\"snippet\":\"\",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jason_and_the_Argonauts_(1963_film)\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d27\"},\"ref\":\"d27\",\"snippet\":\"\",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Richard_Todd\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d26\"},\"ref\":\"d26\",\"snippet\":\"\",\"title\":\"https://cjuhsd.net/apps/pages/index.jsp?uREC_ID=1772707&type=d&pREC_ID=1952189\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"